OL,3,GNEWSA'There's nothing better than being
OL,4,Aa paramedic'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA paramedic who is part of a new series
OL,7,Fdocumenting frontline emergency medical
OL,8,Fcare says he "can't think of doing
OL,9,Fanything better".
OL,11,FSouth West Ambulance Service, which
OL,12,Fcovers the west of England as well as
OL,13,FDevon, Dorset and Cornwall, features on
OL,14,FChannel 4's new 999: On The Front Line
OL,15,Fseries over 10 episodes.
OL,17,FThe show reveals the realities of crews
OL,18,Fworking out of stations in Bristol,
OL,19,FBridgwater and Taunton to help millions
OL,20,Fof people every year.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
