OL,3,GNEWSA'There's nothing better than being
OL,4,Aa paramedic'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLee, who is one of the paramedics on
OL,7,Fthe show, said: "It's not something you
OL,8,Fcan easily describe, the feeling you
OL,9,Fget when can do something to save
OL,10,Fsomebody's life. I can't think of doing
OL,11,Fanything better."
